WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Onboarded does not mean assigned work.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Keep every work milestone and its evidence separate.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
See the status in a simple, private-first work trail.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A sample task reference changes the status.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Assignment is not payment. Payment stays unrecorded.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
TaskLatch. Personal open-source demo. Synthetic data.
